6. TERMINATION

6.1 Your rights under this license terminate automatically if You breach any
of its terms.

6.2 If the breach is curable, Your rights are reinstated upon cure within 30
days of the date You become aware of the breach, provided the cure occurs
before Licensor has notified You of the breach; or, where Licensor has
notified You, upon cure within 30 days of that notice.

6.3 Sections 1, 4, 5, 7, and 8 survive termination.


